<title>INDIA: Indian coalition asks Congess party for talks.</title>
<headline>Indian coalition asks Congess party for talks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's ruling United Front sent a formal letter to start talks with the Congress party on Wednesday but said there was no question of removing Prime Minister H.D. Deve Gowda.</p>
</text>
